%% M8 sequence: retries, dead letter and admin replay. Planned design: follows contracts/openapi/webhook-service.v1.yaml and issue #21.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P0 as Redis<br/>BullMQ
    participant P1 as webhook-service
    participant P2 as Merchant<br/>endpoint
    participant P3 as MongoDB<br/>webhooks
    participant P4 as Kafka
    participant P5 as Admin page<br/>+ BFF
    actor P6 as Admin
        P0->>P1: worker takes the job (attempt 1)
        P1->>P2: signed POST
        P2-->>P1: 503 or timeout after 10 s
        P1->>P3: append attempt (status, latency, error), status RETRYING, nextRetryAt
        P1->>P0: throw: BullMQ schedules the next delay
        Note over P0,P1: delays 30 s, 2 m, 10 m, 30 m, 2 h, 6 h: 7 attempts in total, shorter delays by config for the demo
        P0->>P1: attempts 2 to 7: a fresh t and signature each time
        alt an attempt returns 2xx
            P1->>P3: status DELIVERED
        else attempt 7 fails
            P1->>P3: append attempt, status DEAD
            P1->>P4: publish WebhookDeliveryDeadLettered (key deliveryId, no payload data)
            P4-->>P1: acknowledged
        end
        P6->>P5: open Admin, Webhooks (later, after the merchant recovers)
        P5->>P1: GET /api/v1/admin/webhooks/deliveries?status=DEAD via gateway
        P1-->>P5: dead-lettered deliveries
        P6->>P5: click Replay
        P5->>P1: POST /api/v1/admin/webhooks/deliveries/{id}/replay
        alt caller is not ADMIN
            P1-->>P5: 403 problem+json
        else delivery is not DEAD
            P1-->>P5: 409 problem+json
        else ADMIN and DEAD
            P1->>P3: status PENDING, earlier attempts are kept in the log
            P1->>P0: enqueue a new job with a fresh attempt budget
            P1-->>P5: 202 Queued
            P0->>P1: worker takes the job
            P1->>P2: signed POST (same id, new t and signature)
            P2-->>P1: 200
            P1->>P3: status DELIVERED
        end
